      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01190",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "\"你干了让我们为难的事啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You have done something that has put us in a difficult position.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01190",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "今后若再发生这等事，寺庙就无法再留你了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If something like this happens again, the temple will no longer be able to keep you here.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01190",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "请你好生记住。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Please remember that well.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01190",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "另外还有……\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "And one more thing...\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01190",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "老师话到这里，就缄口不言，大概是顾忌柏木在场吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The teacher stopped speaking at that point, probably out of consideration for Kashiwagi being present.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01190",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "接着他又说：\"钱由我来还。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then he added, \"I will repay the money.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01190",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "你可以退下去了。\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You may leave now.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
